OL,3,GNEWSASheep fair still going strong
OL,4,Aafter 788 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sheep fair is being staged for the
OL,7,F788th time.
OL,9,FMagna Carta was still in living memory
OL,10,Fwhen King Henry III granted a royal
OL,11,Fcharter for the Corby Glen Sheep Fair,
OL,12,Fin southern Lincolnshire, in 1238.
OL,14,FThe modern-day event, which runs until
OL,15,FSunday, still features a sheep auction,
OL,16,Falongside trades stalls, a funfair and
OL,17,Flive music.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
