OL,3,GNEWSASheep fair still going strong
OL,4,Aafter 788 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Thompson, the festival's
OL,7,Fsecretary, said: "We do have a live
OL,8,Fauction and there will be trucks
OL,9,Farriving on Saturday morning full of
OL,10,Fsheep for sale, but obviously not in
OL,11,Fthe tens of thousands anymore as it
OL,12,Fwould have been in its heyday."
